# Optional production signing

Copy to `android/keystore.properties` (gitignored) and point `storeFile` at your
release keystore. Release signing is applied only when this file exists.

```properties
storeFile=C:/path/to/van-release.jks
storePassword=
keyAlias=van
keyPassword=
```

Do not commit keystores, passwords, or a filled `keystore.properties`.
